@startuml Feature10_Seq_1
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 10: Application Pipeline - Sequence: Advance State**

actor Recruiter
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nApplicationPipelineController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nApplicationStateService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nApplicationRepository" as Repo
participant "<<repository>>\nActivityLogRepository" as LogRepo
participant "<<service>>\nNotificationService" as Notify
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

Recruiter -> UI: Drag & Drop Application to new Stage
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/applications/{id}/advance
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: TransitionAsync(companyId, userId, appId, toState, reason)
activate Svc

Svc -> Repo: GetByIdAsync(companyId, appId)
activate Repo
Repo --> Svc: return Application
deactivate Repo

note right of Svc: Validate StateMachine Guard\n(e.g. Ensure Interview Score exists)

Svc -> Repo: TransitionStateAsync(appId, toState, ...)
activate Repo
Repo -> DbContext: ExecuteSql(Update)
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: SQL UPDATE
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: success
deactivate DB
DbContext --> Repo: success
deactivate DbContext
Repo --> Svc: return 1
deactivate Repo

Svc -> LogRepo: InsertAsync(activityLog)
activate LogRepo
LogRepo --> Svc: ok
deactivate LogRepo

Svc -> Notify: SendResultAsync(companyId, appId, toState)
activate Notify
Notify --> Svc: ok
deactivate Notify

Svc --> Ctrl: return ApplicationStateDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Recruiter: Update Kanban Board
deactivate UI
@enduml
